    3: @dataclass
    2: class ClutCpuBackend:
    1:     """CPU-only sampler backend using cLUT logistic Bernoulli draws.
       
           The adapter keeps the existing backend call shape: callers pass Ising
           biases, couplings, sample count, and runtime config. Internally it computes
